  m_Text: "• Fixed aircraft skins not displaying properly\r\n• Fixed AGM-99 appearing as AGM-98 when selected as current weapon\r\n• Fixed Mission Editor copy unit info button not copying inventories\r\n• Fixed Opal Airport being unavailable in free flight\r\n• Added additional hangars in Free Flight to international airport, allowing both teams to spawn there\r\n• Added LODs for FS-20 Vortex\r\n• Fixed LCV25 displaying AGM-48s equipped when firing GTG missiles\r\n• Fixed typo in OTB-31 landing craft description\r\n• Improved Annex class LODs\r\n• Fixed aircraft position not being synced for clients in MP after aircraft is disabled"
--- !u!114 &1358
